{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function injectHotkeyRecorder(options): AngularHotkeyRecorder;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/angular-hotkeys/src/injectHotkeyRecorder.ts#L57","children":[{"type":"text","value":"injectHotkeyRecorder.ts:57"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Angular inject-based API for recording keyboard shortcuts."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Thin wrapper around the framework-agnostic HotkeyRecorder class: captures\nkeyboard events, converts them to hotkey strings, and handles Escape to\ncancel or Backspace/Delete to clear."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HotkeyRecorderOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" | (() => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HotkeyRecorderOptions"},{"type":"text","value":")"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configuration options for the recorder (or getter)"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/AngularHotkeyRecorder.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AngularHotkeyRecorder"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Object with recording state signals and control functions"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"@Component({ ... })\nexport class ShortcutSettingsComponent {\n  shortcut = signal<Hotkey>('Mod+S')\n  recorder = injectHotkeyRecorder({\n    onRecord: (hotkey) => this.shortcut.set(hotkey),\n    onCancel: () => console.log('Recording cancelled'),\n  })\n\n  constructor() {\n    injectHotkey(\n      () => this.shortcut(),\n      () => this.handleSave(),\n    )\n  }\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction injectHotkeyRecorder(options): AngularHotkeyRecorder;\n```\n\nDefined in: [injectHotkeyRecorder.ts:57](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/angular-hotkeys/src/injectHotkeyRecorder.ts#L57)\n\nAngular inject-based API for recording keyboard shortcuts.\n\nThin wrapper around the framework-agnostic HotkeyRecorder class: captures\nkeyboard events, converts them to hotkey strings, and handles Escape to\ncancel or Backspace/Delete to clear.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`HotkeyRecorderOptions` \\| (() => `HotkeyRecorderOptions`)\n\nConfiguration options for the recorder (or getter)\n\n## Returns\n\n[`AngularHotkeyRecorder`](../interfaces/AngularHotkeyRecorder.md)\n\nObject with recording state signals and control functions\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n@Component({ ... })\nexport class ShortcutSettingsComponent {\n  shortcut = signal<Hotkey>('Mod+S')\n  recorder = injectHotkeyRecorder({\n    onRecord: (hotkey) => this.shortcut.set(hotkey),\n    onCancel: () => console.log('Recording cancelled'),\n  })\n\n  constructor() {\n    injectHotkey(\n      () => this.shortcut(),\n      () => this.handleSave(),\n    )\n  }\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: injectHotkeyRecorder\ntitle: injectHotkeyRecorder\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction injectHotkeyRecorder(options): AngularHotkeyRecorder;\n```\n\nDefined in: [injectHotkeyRecorder.ts:57](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/angular-hotkeys/src/injectHotkeyRecorder.ts#L57)\n\nAngular inject-based API for recording keyboard shortcuts.\n\nThin wrapper around the framework-agnostic HotkeyRecorder class: captures\nkeyboard events, converts them to hotkey strings, and handles Escape to\ncancel or Backspace/Delete to clear.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`HotkeyRecorderOptions` \\| (() => `HotkeyRecorderOptions`)\n\nConfiguration options for the recorder (or getter)\n\n## Returns\n\n[`AngularHotkeyRecorder`](../interfaces/AngularHotkeyRecorder.md)\n\nObject with recording state signals and control functions\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n@Component({ ... })\nexport class ShortcutSettingsComponent {\n  shortcut = signal<Hotkey>('Mod+S')\n  recorder = injectHotkeyRecorder({\n    onRecord: (hotkey) => this.shortcut.set(hotkey),\n    onCancel: () => console.log('Recording cancelled'),\n  })\n\n  constructor() {\n    injectHotkey(\n      () => this.shortcut(),\n      () => this.handleSave(),\n    )\n  }\n}\n```\n"}
